# Cadless — environment template. Copy to .env and fill in what you need.
#
# Everything here is optional. Without a key the app still runs: you can browse
# the bundled catalog, change parameters, rebuild, and export. A key is what
# turns on generating new parts from a description.
#
# You can also set all of this from the Settings panel in the app, which stores
# it under the data volume and applies it without a restart. When a variable is
# set here as well, the environment variable wins.

# ── Model provider ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# anthropic | openai | bedrock
CADLESS_LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic

# Anthropic — https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# OpenAI — https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# AWS Bedrock — standard credential resolution applies, so an instance role or
# ~/.aws/credentials works too and these can stay blank.
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# AWS_SESSION_TOKEN=

# ── Retrieval ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The tool grounds generation on your own past successes once you have some.
# This needs an embedding model, which Anthropic does not offer — with the
# anthropic provider retrieval is skipped and generation falls back to the
# built-in curated examples. Bedrock and OpenAI users get it automatically.

# ── Catalog ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where catalog items live. Mounted read-only into the containers.
# CADLESS_CATALOG_ROOT=./catalog

# ── Storage ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database, baked artifacts and saved settings. Backed by the `data` volume.
CADLESS_DATA_DIR=/data

# ── Execution limits ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Wall-clock ceiling for one code execution.
# CADLESS_EXEC_TIMEOUT_SECS=30

# ── Networking ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The only published port. Keep this bound to localhost: the settings endpoint
# stores API keys and has no authentication.
# CADLESS_PROXY_PORT=8800
